  message: "Fixed in PR #47 (commit d138d7b). Added 30 library_patterns to go.yaml: 15 write (.Set, .Add, .Put, .Delete, .Remove, .Update, .Insert, .Append, .Push, .Pop, .Clear, .Reset, .Close, .Store, .Swap) and 15 read (.Get, .Find, .Lookup, .Load, .Fetch, .Query, .Search, .Select, .Has, .Contains, .Exists, .Len, .Size, .Count)."  # 3a8c
